[{"id":"addon:night_shroud:ghost_face_caught_on_tape","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-16","title":"《被拍摄到的鬼面》","titleEn":"\"Ghost Face Caught on Tape\"","rarity":"ultra","description":["奥尔森持有的录像带，以此写出的文章让罗斯威尔镇人心惶惶。","·普通攻击让逃生者陷入濒死状态可立刻使夜幕重新充能。"],"flavor":"“在这卷录像中，一名黑衣人影趁着夜色闯入了佛罗里达州罗斯威尔镇北部的一处房屋。警察次日清晨接到报案称有一起谋杀案在此发生。锁好你的大门：我们之中有一名肆意游荡的杀手，就像是黑夜中的鬼面。”——罗斯威尔公报","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_caughtOnTape.webp","glyph":1,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/%22Ghost_Face_Caught_on_Tape%22","pinyin":"beipaishedaodeguimian","initials":"bpsddgm"},{"id":"addon:night_shroud:outdoor_security_camera","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-16","title":"户外监控摄像头","titleEn":"Outdoor Security Camera","rarity":"ultra","description":["这台监控摄像头里拍到了鬼面闯入罗斯威尔镇北部贝拉维尔街的一处房屋。摄像头的位置刚刚好能捕捉到鬼面的身影，但又无法向警方提供任何实用线索。","·当一名被标记的逃生者陷入濒死状态时，所有逃生者气场会显示7秒。"],"flavor":"“一张图片胜过千言万语。”——鬼面","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_outdoorSecurityCamera.webp","glyph":1,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Outdoor_Security_Camera","pinyin":"huwaijiankongshexiangtou","initials":"hwjksxt"},{"id":"addon:night_shroud:victim_s_detailed_routine","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-16","title":"受害者的详细行程","titleEn":"Victim's Detailed Routine","rarity":"very-rare","description":["这张被撕下的纸页上写着奥尔森在罗斯威尔镇首个受害者的每周行程。对受害者的习惯进行分析使你能够预知其接下来的行动。","·被标记的逃生者会受到疲劳状态影响，持续5秒。","疲劳状态会使逃生者无法激活疲劳相关技能。"],"flavor":"“我关注你有一阵子了。这一次我要它独一无二；成为人们永远无法忘怀的头条新闻。” —鬼面","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_victimsDetailedRoutine.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Victim%27s_Detailed_Routine","pinyin":"shouhaizhedexiangxixingcheng","initials":"shzdxxxc"},{"id":"addon:night_shroud:night_vision_monocular","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-16","title":"夜视镜头","titleEn":"Night Vision Monocular","rarity":"very-rare","description":["即使是在黑暗中，夜视镜头也能拍出清晰的照片。非常适合深夜造访的不速之客。","·发现鬼面的逃生者会受到疲劳状态影响，持续10秒。","疲劳状态会使逃生者无法激活疲劳相关技能。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_nightVisionMonocular.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Night_Vision_Monocular","pinyin":"yeshijingtou","initials":"ysjt"},{"id":"addon:night_shroud:drop_leg_knife_sheath","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-16","title":"绑腿刀鞘","titleEn":"Drop-Leg Knife Sheath","rarity":"very-rare","description":["全方位便携刀鞘：适合迅速造成严重伤口，同时也便于携带者自由移动。丹尼离开宾夕法尼亚当晚从一名巡警身上偷来的。","·鬼面标记一名逃生者后获得10%移动速度加成，持续5秒。"],"flavor":"“要像斥候一样随时准备就绪——但大口袋什么的大蠢了。我这东西可要好上不少。”——鬼面","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_drop-LegKnifeSheath.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Drop-Leg_Knife_Sheath","pinyin":"bangtuidaoqiao","initials":"btdq"},{"id":"addon:night_shroud:driver_s_license","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-16","title":"驾照","titleEn":"Driver's License","rarity":"very-rare","description":["这张驾照表明了奥尔森的真实身份：丹尼·约翰逊。","·标记一名正在修理发电机的逃生者时，该发电机将爆炸并损失20%进度。","·受影响的发电机将被封锁15秒。","·同时标记多名逃生者时，进度损失只生效一次。"],"flavor":"“人们都想知道鬼面究竟是谁。但他们真正该问的问题是，谁才是下一个。”——鬼面","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_driversLicense.webp","glyph":2,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Driver%27s_License","pinyin":"jiazhao","initials":"jz"},{"id":"addon:night_shroud:knife_belt_clip","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-16","title":"利刃皮带扣","titleEn":"Knife Belt Clip","rarity":"rare","description":["让你能轻松携带利刃的完美皮带扣。没人知晓你今晚将要犯下怎样的罪行。","·蹲伏时恐惧范围减少12米。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_knifeBeltClip.webp","glyph":2,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Knife_Belt_Clip","pinyin":"lirenpidaikou","initials":"lrpdk"},{"id":"addon:night_shroud:olsen_s_wallet","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-16","title":"奥尔森的钱包","titleEn":"Olsen's Wallet","rarity":"rare","description":["奥尔森的钱包里装着三十美金、一张视频俱乐部会员卡以及一张折起来的奥尔森在罗斯威尔首个受害者的照片。随身携带犯罪证据会让你更加亢奋而坚定。","·普通摧毁木板或墙壁可立刻使夜幕重新充能。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_olsensWallet.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Olsen%27s_Wallet","pinyin":"aoersendeqianbao","initials":"aesdqb"},{"id":"addon:night_shroud:lasting_perfume","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-16","title":"持久香水","ti