t.wiki.gg/wiki/Headline_Cut-Outs","pinyin":"toutiaojiantie","initials":"ttjt"},{"id":"addon:night_shroud:cheap_cologne","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-16","title":"廉价古龙水","titleEn":"Cheap Cologne","rarity":"common","description":["平价店的古龙水，有股强烈的医用酒精味道。鬼面用这个让自己为人所知。非常适合深夜造访的不速之客。","· 标记持续时间增加10秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_cheapCologne.webp","glyph":7,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Cheap_Cologne","pinyin":"lianjiagulongshui","initials":"ljgls"},{"id":"addon:night_shroud:walleye_s_matchbook","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-16","title":"白星眼酒吧纸板火柴","titleEn":"Walleye's Matchbook","rarity":"common","description":["这些火柴来自白星眼酒吧，罗斯威尔镇北部的一处小酒吧。有行蓝字记着一名受害者的电话号码。这是找到的犯罪证据之一。","·夜幕恢复时间减少2秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_walleyesMatchbook.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Walleye%27s_Matchbook","pinyin":"baixingyanjiubazhibanhuochai","initials":"bxyjbzbhc"}]
